# Results
# evaluation.npz (about 13 MB per run) is regenerated from the saved policy.pt by run_all.py.
# The launcher logs contain local absolute paths.
# results/smoke/ is the output of the smoke run in the README.
# config.json, training.csv and policy.pt of every run are kept.
results/**/evaluation.npz
results/*.log
results/smoke/
